            "text_TBmBVV": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>With over 25 years in dermatology and aesthetic medicine, Dr. Goel has treated thousands of patients across India.<br/><br/>Her clinical expertise spans acne management, pigmentation, anti-aging therapies, laser treatments, and advanced non-surgical skin rejuvenation. As the head of Cutis Skin Solution, she has built a practice rooted in precision, transparency, and patient trust.<br/><br/>Her work is grounded in science but delivered with empathy.<br/>Because expertise matters. But so does how you make someone feel.<br/><br/></p>",
