            "text_U4GUBz": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Over the years, Dr. Goel noticed something deeper than skin concerns.<br/><br/>Behind acne was self-consciousness. Behind pigmentation was frustration. Behind premature aging was quiet worry. Skin, she realised, is deeply personal.<br/><br/>That insight shaped her philosophy: skincare should empower, not intimidate. It should restore confidence without creating dependency. It should simplify, not complicate. And most importantly, it should support long-term skin health not temporary fixes.</p>",
                "width": "fit-content",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
