            "text_AF7nat": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Dr. Goel believes that skin health should be seen as an act of self-love not vanity.<br/><br/>She envisions a world where individuals understand their skin, respect it, and care for it consistently without fear, pressure, or unrealistic standards.<br/><br/>Through Oladerm, her mission is simple: To make dermatologist-backed skincare feel accessible, honest, and nurturing — so that every individual feels at home in their skin.<br/>Because when skin feels supported, confidence follows.<br/>And that confidence lasts.</p>",
